    },
    {
      "_id": "XSMDYL3wgunvPdAO",
      "name": "Constrict",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The creature crushes the opponent, dealing bludgeoning damage, after making a successful grapple check. The amount of damage is given in the creature’s entry. If the creature also has the improved grab ability (see below), it deals constriction damage in addition to damage dealt by the weapon used to grab.</p>",
        "source": "d20 Modern SRD",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/specialabilities.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.y98NYAYGT9GM5Mox.JournalEntryPage.vhTyLUgTw1jBipWT",
        "abilityType": "extraordinary",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!Gir1NtFWGE4Zc214.XSMDYL3wgunvPdAO"
    },
    {
      "_id": "MYesEqWp7UsxriZN",
      "name": "Expansion",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>A toxic sludge absorbs the bodies of creatures it has killed in battle. This process takes a number of rounds depending on the size of the corpse: Diminutive or smaller 1, Tiny 2, Small 4, Medium-size 8, Large 16, Huge 32, Gargantuan 64, and Colossal 128. The sludge grows by 1 Hit Die for every 16 rounds it spends consuming bodies, to a maximum of 45 Hit Dice.</p>",
        "source": "Menace Manual",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/menacecreat4.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.gkO7BHtoB7PZOT9Q.JournalEntryPage.QvZNL5dJUs6a3FCL",
        "abilityType": "extraordinary",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!Gir1NtFWGE4Zc214.MYesEqWp7UsxriZN"
    },
    {
      "_id": "ygzIDaDGyyjZDVGf",
      "name": "Immunities",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Toxic sludges are immune to acid, electricity, and cold damage. If a cold attack deals damage equal to or greater than a toxic sludge’s Constitution score, the toxic sludge is affected as though by a slow spell.</p>",
        "source": "Menace Manual",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/menacecreat4.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.gkO7BHtoB7PZOT9Q.JournalEntryPage.QvZNL5dJUs6a3FCL",
        "abilityType": "extraordinary",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!Gir1NtFWGE4Zc214.ygzIDaDGyyjZDVGf"
    },
    {
      "_id": "7Vuj12KYAAqjAl0H",
      "name": "Improved Grab",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>To use this ability, the toxic sludge must hit an opponent at least one size category smaller than itself with its slam attack. If it gets a hold, it automatically deals slam damage each round that the hold is maintained, and it can constrict in the same round.</p>",
        "source": "Menace Manual",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/menacecreat4.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.gkO7BHtoB7PZOT9Q.JournalEntryPage.QvZNL5dJUs6a3FCL",
        "abilityType": "extraordinary",
